n\r\nPaused:\r\n```\r\n22:43:54.304 playWhenReady [eventTime=179.38, mediaPos=177.40, window=0, period=0, false, USER_REQUEST]\r\n22:43:54.307 isPlaying [eventTime=179.38, mediaPos=177.41, window=0, period=0, false]\r\n```\r\n\r\nWait till there will be +90 sec of buffered data (compared to current pos). Unpause:\r\n\r\n```\r\n2020-03-17 22:45:43.524 2883-2883/by.stari4ek.tvirl.debug D/EventLogger: playWhenReady [eventTime=288.60, mediaPos=177.41, window=0, period=0, true, USER_REQUEST]\r\n2020-03-17 22:45:43.526 2883-2883/by.stari4ek.tvirl.debug D/EventLogger: isPlaying [eventTime=288.60, mediaPos=177.43, window=0, period=0, true]\r\n```\r\n\r\nSeek:\r\n```\r\n22:46:18.974 seekStarted [eventTime=324.05, mediaPos=212.83, window=0, period=0]\r\n22:46:18.982 positionDiscontinuity [eventTime=324.06, mediaPos=322.05, window=0, period=0, SEEK]\r\n22:46:19.079 positionDiscontinuity [eventTime=324.15, mediaPos=0.00, window=0, period=0, SEEK_ADJUSTMENT]\r\n22:46:19.082 state [eventTime=324.16, mediaPos=0.00, window=0, period=0, BUFFERING]\r\n22:46:19.111 isPlaying [eventTime=324.19, mediaPos=0.00, window=0, period=0, false]\r\n22:46:19.117 seekProcessed [eventTime=324.19, mediaPos=0.00, window=0, period=0]\r\n22:46:20.150 renderedFirstFrame [eventTime=325.23, mediaPos=323.58, window=0, period=0, Surface(name=null)/@0x6d104ad]\r\n22:46:20.276 state [eventTime=325.35, mediaPos=323.58, window=0, period=0, READY]\r\n22:46:20.309 isPlaying [eventTime=325.38, mediaPos=323.61, window=0, period=0, true]\r\n```\r\n\r\nI've debuged a bit MSG_SEEK_TO, and there is:\r\n\r\nstopRenderers()\r\n...\r\nresetRendererPosition(0)\r\nat\r\n```\r\nseekToPeriodPosition:972, ExoPlayerImplInternal (com.google.android.exoplayer2)\r\nseekToPeriodPosition:959, ExoPlayerImplInternal (com.google.android.exoplayer2)\r\nseekToInternal:940, ExoPlayerImplInternal (com.google.android.exoplayer2)\r\nhandleMessage:387, ExoPlayerImplInternal (com.google.android.exoplayer2)\r\ndispatchMessage:101, Handler (android.os)\r\nloop:164, Looper (android.os)\r\nrun:65, HandlerThread (android.os)\r\n```\r\nSo it produces both artifacts during seek (jumping pos and additional \"first frame\")","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/600268147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"stari4ek","id":327778,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzc3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek","html_url":"https://github.com/stari4ek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/600270587","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7097#issuecomment-600270587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7097","id":600270587,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYwMDI3MDU4Nw==","user":{"login":"stari4ek","id":327778,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzc3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek","html_url":"https://github.com/stari4ek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/follower